{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"8599b7763963d7f6cf470cb70d2655909d3e69fdfc58e82c3bc2246f0142ece5","digest":{"component_or_area":"reconciler read/check operation paths","key_entities":["src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/runtime.py","src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/_backend_registry.py","ReconcilerSettings","GitRuntime","BridgeRuntime","reconcile-check","load_config()","SecretStr","SecretBytes"],"problem_keywords":["reconciler","read/check paths","ambient configuration reload","immutable runtime settings","configuration authority","Jira backend composition"],"propositions":["Reconciler read/check paths call load_config() and inspect environment/cwd, allowing ambient configuration changes to alter read scope mid-operation or discard supplied registry config.","Jira backend construction from ambient settings allows properties to reload settings and change tracker layout, project scope, and query constraints during a single operation.","read/check call paths must be refactored to consume immutable ReconcilerSettings, GitRuntime, and BridgeRuntime projections with stable Jira backend bindings that cannot be reloaded by environment or file mutations.","Preflight, access check, fetch, paging, diff, mapper, sanitizer, tracker reads, and Git ref resolution must thread through a single composed backend/runtime to eliminate ambient reloads from all read/check paths.","Secrets in static auth carriers must use non-serializable Pydantic types and be excluded from repr/equality/hash/cache/fingerprint, unwrapping only in the selected Jira sending adapter.","Failure cases—missing/conflicting auth, empty project scope, malformed config/TLS, and unselected provider access—must fail before any Jira model request or local write with typed redacted errors."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787033389091106001,"uuid":"022b28cd-28a2-49a2-9311-6f3f53093369"}